{"metadata":{"title":"Moon Phases","modules":[{"name":"AstronomyKit"}],"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AstronomyKit\/documentation\/AstronomyKit\/MoonPhases","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/astronomykit\/moonphases"]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Calculate moon phases, quarters, libration, and lunar nodes.","type":"text"}],"kind":"article","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AstronomyKit\/documentation\/AstronomyKit"]]},"sections":[],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/AstronomyKit\/documentation\/AstronomyKit\/Moon","doc:\/\/AstronomyKit\/documentation\/AstronomyKit\/MoonPhase","doc:\/\/AstronomyKit\/documentation\/AstronomyKit\/MoonQuarter","doc:\/\/AstronomyKit\/documentation\/AstronomyKit\/Libration","doc:\/\/AstronomyKit\/documentation\/AstronomyKit\/LunarNode","doc:\/\/AstronomyKit\/documentation\/AstronomyKit\/NodeKind"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Moon","title":"Moon"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AstronomyKit\/documentation\/AstronomyKit\/Moon","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" type provides comprehensive lunar calculations including phase angles, illumination, quarter searches, libration data, and node crossings."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Phase Angle","anchor":"Phase-Angle"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The phase angle indicates the Moon’s position in its cycle:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["let angle = try Moon.phaseAngle(at: .now)","print(\"Phase angle: \\(angle)°\")","\/\/ 0° = New Moon, 90° = First Quarter, 180° = Full, 270° = Third Quarter"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Phase Names and Emoji","anchor":"Phase-Names-and-Emoji"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Convert angles to human-readable descriptions:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["let angle = try Moon.phaseAngle(at: .now)","","print(Moon.phaseName(for: angle))  \/\/ \"Waxing Gibbous\"","print(Moon.emoji(for: angle))      \/\/ \"🌔\""],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The eight phase names:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"New Moon (🌑)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Waxing Crescent (🌒)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"First Quarter (🌓)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Waxing Gibbous (🌔)"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Full Moon (🌕)"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Waning Gibbous (🌖)"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Third Quarter (🌗)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Waning Crescent (🌘)","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"anchor":"Illumination","level":2,"text":"Illumination","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Calculate the fraction of the Moon that’s lit:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let angle = try Moon.phaseAngle(at: .now)","let illumination = Moon.illumination(for: angle)","print(\"Moon is \\(Int(illumination * 100))% illuminated\")"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"anchor":"Finding-Quarter-Phases","level":2,"text":"Finding Quarter Phases","type":"heading"},{"anchor":"Search-for-a-Specific-Phase","level":3,"text":"Search for a Specific Phase","type":"heading"},{"code":["\/\/ Next full moon (nil if none occurs within the search window)","if let fullMoon = try Moon.searchPhase(.full, after: .now) {","    print(\"Next full moon: \\(fullMoon)\")","}"],"